@baseUrl = http://localhost:5197

### Tüm notları getir
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/exam-results
Accept: application/json

###

### Öğrenci 1 ekle
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/exam-results
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentName": "Ali İhsan",
  "score": 80
}

###

### Öğrenci 2 ekle
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/exam-results
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentName": "Ayşe Kaya",
  "score": 95
}

